    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Core Rulebook</i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You are particularly adept at hitting the right target in a crowd.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Point-Blank_Shot\" title=\"Point-Blank Shot\">Point-Blank Shot</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Precise_Shot\" title=\"Precise Shot\">Precise Shot</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Base Attack Bonus\">Base Attack Bonus</a> +4</p><p><b>Effect:</b> You always ignore <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Soft_Cover\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Soft Cover\">Soft Cover</a> (that is, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cover\" title=\"Cover\">Cover</a> provided by a character, creature, or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a>) when you make a ranged attack.</p><p><b>Normal:</b> You can only ignore <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cover\" title=\"Cover\">Cover</a> if you <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Aim\" title=\"Aim\">Aim</a> before making a ranged attack.</p>",
